# Stable spec ID: morgenthaler-pink. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(choice 1) = (gin @ ~Aviation) 2 oz -OR- (gin @ Plymouth) 2 oz -OR- (gin @ Hendrick's) 2 oz
(liqueur; blackcurrant) 0.75 oz
(lemon: juice, fresh) 0.5 oz
(simple syrup) 2 tsp

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(cocktail glass, 9oz)

::instructions
<shake, measured ingredients with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<strain, into a chilled (cocktail glass, 9oz)>
<garnish, with a lemon wedge>

::notes
This records one source-specific version; no universal formula or automatic product substitution is implied.
OSF selects the source’s simple lemon garnish, rather than the flower presentation. The formula leaves cassis generic; the article mentions Mathilde, without making it required.

